# Dependencies for the training and drift containers.
#
# Includes everything in serving.in because the pipeline runs the same ONNX
# parity check the serving container will run, plus PyTorch, MLflow and the data
# stack. This image is large and that is fine: it runs on a node group that
# scales to zero, not on the request path.

-c serving.txt

torch==2.10.0
onnx==1.20.0
# torch.onnx.export uses the dynamo exporter by default from torch 2.6 onward,
# and that path imports onnxscript. Without it the export raises ModuleNotFoundError
# at the end of a training run, which is the most expensive possible place to
# discover a missing dependency.
onnxscript==0.7.2
mlflow==3.16.0
psycopg2-binary==2.9.13
pandas==3.0.5
pyarrow==25.0.1
boto3==1.43.93
PyYAML==6.0.3
onnxruntime==1.30.0
numpy==2.5.3
prometheus-client==0.26.0
